      "text": "In the morning, set out with your guide to explore the Argentine capital.\n\n\n\n\nThe route takes in a commemorative monument and the neighbourhoods of La Boca and San Telmo, with their many cafés and small restaurants. You can browse antiques at Plaza Dorrego. Then continue to Plaza de Mayo and the Casa Rosada, the famous Pink House. Your guide will tell you about the city’s history and Evita Perón."
